<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 581.97, up 2.37.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.06.</p>
<p>Breadth was positive. Winners beat losers 271 to 243.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 22,992,430 compared with 16,874,580 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
